# The ignore file of samples/http/Dockerfile, whose build context is the repository's root. BuildKit
# reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile before `.dockerignore` at the context's root.
# Same rules as deployment-docker's .dockerignore, at any depth.

# Secrets: compose.yaml passes samples/http/.env at run time; never baked into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# State: a volume at run time.
**/.pikit

# Installed inside the image from bun.lock, for its own platform.
**/node_modules

.git
